            "type": "text",
            "text": "anointing oil",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to a corpse casts a 5th-rank "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "2d4c6edd-9059-52d9-b547-c7da47a9c1c5"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on it. The effects last for 24 hours. The funerary rites of the Knights of Lastwall sometimes include using this type of oil on their dead if they are to be buried."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
